SyncroPrint for Linux
Copyright (c) 2026 SyncroPrint for Linux contributors

This project reimplements, for Linux, the wire protocol of AutoPrintr,
an MIT-licensed open-source application by RepairShopr:

  https://github.com/RepairShopr/AutoPrintr-wpf
  https://github.com/RepairShopr/AutoPrintr-win
  https://github.com/RepairShopr/AutoPrintr-mac

No AutoPrintr source code is included in this project; the repositories
were used as a protocol reference (see PROTOCOL.md for citations).

